# Keeps local artefacts out of the Docker build context (deploy/docker/Dockerfile.*). The obj/ trees
# restored under Windows would overwrite the restore done in the image (Windows package paths in
# project.assets.json), and the folders below have no business in an image layer.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.codex/
.worktrees/
.vs/
.vscode/
.playwright-mcp/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/TestResults/
artifacts/
tests/
samples/
docs/
# Written by the local launcher with the developer's API address; never part of an image.
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/*.user
**/*.log
